like "Ringo?", so I think I'm going to go

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.100
with Ringo.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.199
John: Who is your third favorite member of
One Direction?

00:00:38.199 --> 00:00:40.110
Tyler: Hmm, oh, hmm.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.730
That's harder than the Beatles's one!

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:42.730
